    "reviews": "\u201cTrue Fear: Forsaken Souls is a genuinely frightening, engrossing, and engaging hidden-object adventure\u201d<br>4,6/5 \u2013 Jayisgames<br><br>\u201cTrue Fear: Forsaken Souls is an awesomely creepy game and it certainly should not be played alone, at night or in the dark\u201d<br>4,5/5 \u2013 AllAboutCasualGames<br><br>\u201cthis is not for the faint of heart\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 JeuXpo<br>",
